      "sha256": "8ff046ffbadc5794fcd2f8fe93d3bb947c736dec650aa3a3cd6e2412b7da8e68",
      "reason": "The question regrids only for display, and this fragment supports computing the masks and comparison statistics on the native grids because regridding changes the land-sea mask and conservation properties.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "Regrid only for the cell-by-cell comparison (maps, pattern correlation, RMSE); compute means, trends and integrals on each model's own grid with its own cell areas, and state the regrid method ('conservative' going to a coarser grid)."
      ]
    }
